i/  $a_1 \ge a_2 \ge \dots \ge a_n$;
ii/  $\sum_{i=1}^{n} a_i = 0$;
iii/  $\sum_{i=1}^{n} a_i^2 = n(n-1)$.

Determine the maximum and minimum possible values of the expression $T = a_1 + a_2$.

negatives.text:
